| `changelog_fragments.folder` | path or null | `changelog.d` in keel; `null` in a generated project; absent, null, which its reader reports as `[using default] changelog_fragments.folder = null` | root of unreleased entries; null disables assembly | `scripts/assemble_fragments.py` via `scripts/config_loader.py` | Controls Unreleased assembly; missing configured folders fail closed. | reference rows: `reference_fragments` | always |
